  unitName: Light Pot
  unitId: 50191
  unitNumber: 310
  description: A curious creature that lives in a pot which is said to hold a power
    capable of dramatically changing the properties of light. As gentle and friendly
    to humans as it may be, it has a tendency to test those who wish to make the
    power it has hidden in its pot their own, making it likely very difficult to
    get ahold of. One also mustn't forget that simply touching the horn on its head
    can send it into a rage.
  summonDesc: Do you know fully <br>how to use my pot?<br>Hey! No touching the horn!
